false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-09-28T21:07:30Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:35:42Z","closed_at":"2025-10-01T23:08:02Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111013","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111013","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111013.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111013.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-01T23:08:02Z"},"body":"# Summary\r\n\r\n* Moves `reflect_spirv` to `RenderingShaderContainer` and simplifies call sites, which now only have to call `set_shader_from_spirv`\r\n* Makes `SpvReflectShaderModule` available to subclasses for additional introspection of SPIR-V\r\n* 💧Fixes memory leak in `reflect_spirv` that would not deallocate the `SpvReflectShaderModule` if an error occurred.\r\n* Removes unnecessary allocation when creating `SpvReflectShaderModule` by passing `NO_COPY` flag to `spvReflectCreateShaderModule2` constructor function.\r\n* Replaces `VectorView` with `Span` for consistency\r\n* 💧Fixes unnecessary allocations in D3D12 shader container in `_convert_spirv_to_nir` and `_convert_spirv_to_dxil` which implicitly converted the `VectorView` to a `Vector`\r\n* 🏎️IWYU updates to `rendering_device.h` and `shader_baker_export_plugin.h` so that changing `rendering_shader_container.h` drops from over 950 compilation units to about 15, when modifying it.\r\n\r\n> [!IMPORTANT]\r\n>\r\n> This PR doesn't change the behaviour of the container or Metal in any way. Future PRs will leverage the API changes.\r\n\r\n# Details\r\n\r\nThis change moves `reflect_spirv` to `RenderingShaderContainer` so that derived types have access to the reflected SPIR-V. This is achieved by introducing a new type, `RenderingShaderContainer::ReflectedShaderStage`, that derived types use to access SPIR-V and the reflected module, `SpvReflectShaderModule`. Implementations may use the reflection information to compile their platform-specific module. \r\n\r\nThe Metal implementation will use this information to analyse the descriptor sets and pass stable binding information to SPIRV-Cross to ensure argument buffers have the same layout between rendering pipeline stages. The goal will ultimately be to simplify and reduce the amount of CPU-side code that is executed to bind uniform sets to pipelines. Further, the Metal shader container _should_ be able to remove all the SPIRV-Cross reflection in favour of the `SpvReflectShaderModule`, further reducing maintenance burden.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111013/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111013/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}